#: kaccess.cpp:469
msgid "Do you really want to deactivate \"%1\"?"
msgstr "\"%1\" çınnan sälätsezländerergä teliseñme?"

#: kaccess.cpp:472
msgid "Do you really want to deactivate \"%1\" and \"%2\"?"
msgstr "\"%1\" häm \"%2\" çınnan sälätsezländerergä teliseñme?"

#: kaccess.cpp:475
msgid "Do you really want to deactivate \"%1\", \"%2\" and \"%3\"?"
msgstr "\"%1\", \"%2\" häm \"%3\" çınnan sälätsezländerergä teliseñme?"

#: kaccess.cpp:479
msgid "Do you really want to deactivate \"%1\", \"%2\", \"%3\" and \"%4\"?"
msgstr "\"%1\", \"%2\", \"%3\" häm \"%4\" çınnan sälätsezländerergä teliseñme?"

#: kaccess.cpp:486
msgid "Do you really want to activate \"%1\"?"
msgstr "\"%1\" çınnan sälätländerergä teliseñme?"

#: kaccess.cpp:489
msgid "Do you really want to activate \"%1\" and to deactivate \"%2\"?"
msgstr "\"%1\" sälätländerergä häm \"%2\" sälätsezländerergä çınnan teliseñme?"

#: kaccess.cpp:492
msgid ""
"Do you really want to activate \"%1\" and to deactivate \"%2\" and \"%3\"?"
msgstr ""
"\"%1\" sälätländerergä, \"%2\" häm \"%3\" sälätsezländerergä çınnan teliseñme?"

#: kaccess.cpp:496
msgid ""
"Do you really want to activate \"%1\" and to deactivate \"%2\", \"%3\" and "
"\"%4\"?"
msgstr ""
"\"%1\" sälätländerergä, \"%2\", \"%3\" häm  \"%4\" sälätsezländerergä çınnan "
"teliseñme?"

#: kaccess.cpp:503
msgid "Do you really want to activate \"%1\" and \"%2\"?"
msgstr "\"%1\" häm \"%2\" çınnan sälätländerergä teliseñme?"

#: kaccess.cpp:506
msgid ""
"Do you really want to activate \"%1\" and \"%2\" and to deactivate \"%3\"?"
msgstr ""
"\"%1\" häm \"%2\" sälätländerergä, \"%3\" sälätsezländerergä çınnan teliseñme?"

#: kaccess.cpp:510
msgid ""
"Do you really want to activate \"%1\", and \"%2\" and to deactivate \"%3\" and "
"\"%4\"?"
msgstr ""
"\"%1\" häm \"%2\" sälätländerergä, \"%3\" häm \"%4\" sälätsezländerergä çınnan "
"teliseñme?"

#: kaccess.cpp:517
msgid "Do you really want to activate \"%1\", \"%2\" and \"%3\"?"
msgstr "\"%1\", \"%2\" häm \"%3\" çınnan sälätländerergä teliseñme?"

#: kaccess.cpp:521
msgid ""
"Do you really want to activate \"%1\", \"%2\" and \"%3\" and to deactivate "
"\"%4\"?"
msgstr ""
"\"%1\", \"%2\" häm \"%3\" sälätländerergä, \"%4\" sälätsezländerergä çınnan "
"teliseñme?"

#: kaccess.cpp:527
msgid "Do you really want to activate \"%1\", \"%2\", \"%3\" and \"%4\"?"
msgstr "\"%1\", \"%2\" \"%3\" häm \"%4\" sälätländerergä çınnan teliseñme?"

#: kaccess.cpp:534
msgid "An application has requested to change this setting."
msgstr "Qullanma bü köylämäne üzgärtergä soradı."

#: kaccess.cpp:538
msgid ""
"You held down the Shift key for 8 seconds or an application has requested to "
"change this setting."
msgstr ""
"Sin Shift töymäsenä 8 sekund basıp tordıñ häm qullanma bu köylämäne üzgärtergä "
"soradı."

#: kaccess.cpp:540
msgid ""
"You pressed the Shift key 5 consecutive times or an application has requested "
"to change this setting."
msgstr ""
"Sin Shift töymäsen bertuqtamíça 5 märtäbä bastıñ häm qullanma bu köylämäne "
"üzgärtergä soradı."

#: kaccess.cpp:544
msgid "You pressed %1 or an application has requested to change this setting."
msgstr "Sin %1 bastıñ yä ki qullanma bu köylämäne üzgärtergä soradı."

#: kaccess.cpp:550
msgid ""
"An application has requested to change these settings, or you used a "
"combination of several keyboard gestures."
msgstr ""
"Qullanma bu köylämälärne üzgärtergä soradı, yä ki sin bilgele ber töymä "
"tezmäsen bergä  bastıñ."

#: kaccess.cpp:552
msgid "An application has requested to change these settings."
msgstr "Qullanma bu köylälärmäne üzgärtergä soradı."

#: kaccess.cpp:557
msgid ""
"These AccessX settings are needed for some users with motion impairments and "
"can be configured in the KDE Control Center. You can also turn them on and off "
"with standardized keyboard gestures.\n"
"\n"
"If you do not need them, you can select \"Deactivate all AccessX features and "
"gestures\"."
msgstr ""
"Bu AccessX köylämäläre qayber xäräkäte çiklängän ğäriplär öçen kiräkle häm KDE "
"İdärä Üzägennän köylängän bula ala. Alarnı standartlarğan töymä tezmäläre bergä "
"basıp ta açarğa yä ki yabarğa bula. \n"
"\n"
"Bolar siña kiräk bulmasa, \"Barlıq AccessX mömkinleklären häm töymä tezmälären "
"sälätsezländer\" saylí alasıñ"

